<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of English premier league matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Chelsea 1 (Leboeuf 45th minute) Aston Villa 1 (Townsend 18th).</p>
<p>Halftime 1-1). Attendance: 27,720</p>
<p>Leicester 0 Liverpool 3 (Berger 58th, 77th, Thomas 61st). 0-0.</p>
<p>20,980.</p>
